      "titleZh": "模型路由很简单，直到它不简单",
      "titleEn": "Model Routing Is Simple. Until It Isn’t.",
      "summaryZh": "Hugging Face 发布了一篇关于模型路由的博客文章，探讨了模型路由的复杂性，包括如何选择最佳模型、成本与性能的权衡，以及动态路由策略。文章强调了模型路由在实践中的挑战，并提供了相关工具和资源。",
      "summaryEn": "Hugging Face published a blog post about model routing, exploring its complexities, including how to select the best model, cost-performance trade-offs, and dynamic routing strategies. The article highlights the challenges in practice and provides related tools and resources.",
